units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p s
atom_style atomic
lattice bcc 3.3 orient x 1 0 0 orient y 0 1 0 orient z 0 0 1
region box block 0 20 0 20 0 64.54545454545455 units lattice
create_box 1 box
region target_initial block 0 20 0 20 0 40 units lattice
create_atoms 1 region target_initial
group target region target_initial
region projectile_region block 0 20 0 20 0 20 units lattice
create_atoms 1 region projectile_region
group projectile region projectile_region
group mobile union target projectile
mass 1 92.90638
pair_style eam/fs
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Nb
neighbor 2 bin
neigh_modify delay 0 every 1 check yes
timestep 0.001
velocity mobile create 300 4928459 mom yes rot no dist gaussian units box
thermo 1000
thermo_style custom step time temp pe ke etotal press
fix equil mobile nvt temp 300 300 0.1
run 100000
velocity projectile set NULL NULL 20 units box sum yes
fix prod mobile nve
run 100000
